steps:
UPDATE src/App.tsx:
  a) Remove the import of PracticeLobby from './screens/learner/PracticeLobby'
  b) Add import of PracticeCompletion from './screens/learner/PracticeCompletion'
  c) Add import of { getNextPracticeActivity, updatePracticeLevel, PracticeProfile, PracticeActivityDef } from './data/practiceData'
  d) Change Screen type: remove 'practice-lobby', add 'practice-completion'. Final type:
     type Screen = 'learner-access' | 'dashboard' | 'oral-assessment' | 'oral-completion' | 'silent-assessment' | 'formal-completion' | 'practice-activity' | 'practice-completion'
  e) Add state:
     const [practiceProfile, setPracticeProfile] = useState<PracticeProfile>({ currentLevel: 2, recentScores: [], consecutiveHighScores: 0, consecutiveLowScores: 0, completedActivityIds: [] })
     const [lastActivityTitle, setLastActivityTitle] = useState<string>('')
     const [lastScorePercent, setLastScorePercent] = useState<number>(0)
     (activeActivityId already exists in current App.tsx — keep it)
  f) Replace handleSelectActivity with handleStartPractice:
     const handleStartPractice = () => {
       const act: PracticeActivityDef = getNextPracticeActivity(practiceProfile)
       setActiveActivityId(act.id)
       setLastActivityTitle(act.title)
       setCurrentScreen('practice-activity')
     }
  g) Replace handleActivityComplete:
     const handleActivityComplete = (scorePercent: number) => {
       const updated = updatePracticeLevel(practiceProfile, scorePercent, activeActivityId)
       setPracticeProfile(updated)
       setLastScorePercent(scorePercent)
       setCurrentScreen('practice-completion')
     }
  h) Replace handleActivityBack (rename to inline or keep):
     Back from practice-activity goes to 'dashboard' (not lobby)
  i) Add handleKeepPracticing:
     const handleKeepPracticing = () => {
       // practiceProfile in state is already the UPDATED profile from handleActivityComplete
       const act: PracticeActivityDef = getNextPracticeActivity(practiceProfile)
       setActiveActivityId(act.id)
       setLastActivityTitle(act.title)
       setCurrentScreen('practice-activity')
     }
     IMPORTANT: practiceProfile here reads from the React state variable, which will be the updated profile because setPracticeProfile was called synchronously in handleActivityComplete before setCurrentScreen. This is correct — React batches state updates within an event handler, so both are applied before the next render.
  j) In the switch:
     - Update 'dashboard' case: change onGoToPractice to onStartPractice={handleStartPractice}
     - Remove the 'practice-lobby' case entirely
     - Update 'practice-activity' case: onComplete={handleActivityComplete} onBack={() => setCurrentScreen('dashboard')}
     - Add 'practice-completion' case:
       return (
         <PracticeCompletion
           learnerName={learnerName}
           activityTitle={lastActivityTitle}
           scorePercent={lastScorePercent}
           onKeepPracticing={handleKeepPracticing}
           onBackToDashboard={() => setCurrentScreen('dashboard')}
         />
       )
  k) Remove unused handleActivityBack if it remains after refactor. Verify no unused variables or imports remain.
